Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The automobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such impressive power and speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was young, all we had were\Nshabby horse-drawn carriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This car belongs to U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Senator Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phillips, and touching\Nit results in a beatdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my, young people these days are so full\Nof piss and vinegar Times are a-changin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.39,0:15:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop talking now and\Nproceed to the front seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell are you, Seiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I'm finished with you, you'll rue\Nthe day you ever march into my vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one gets away with doing\Nsomething like this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was valedictorian in both\Nhigh school and college,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.07,0:15:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not to mention captain of\Nthe college wrestling team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after graduation,\Npeople respected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I became a politician!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I own a villa on a thousand-acre\Nplot of land in Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gorgeous model of a\Nwife is 25 years younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I pay more taxes than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:16:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've destroyed every enemy\Nwho's ever stood in my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and someday I'll become president!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm THE Senator Phillips, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, you punk band reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure you rot in\Nprison for the rest of your misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear this, as I won't repeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drive the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This psychopath's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get the hell out of this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.89,0:16:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't, I'm a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive I jumped out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what the hell am I\Ndoing back in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job is to catch up to that truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fail to do so and you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I still in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:16:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can't I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it makes total sense now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still sense D .O.'s sinister bloodlust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its presence is overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.53,0:17:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can bet your ass he's on our trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that D .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somehow knows our precise location?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.85,0:17:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stole the body of my\Ngrandfather, Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense his body, but I can't\Ntell if he's nearby or far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a general feeling, but I\Ndon't know exactly where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like when we got to Cairo,\Nand while I knew he was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't pinpoint his lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for us, the same thing goes for Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he knows is that we're nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's unable to tell\Nthe difference between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he probably doesn't know we've\Nseparated, which is good for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell isn't this working?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars always start up when they\Ndo this kind of thing in movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like there's a traffic jam. I'm\Nsorry, sir, the evening commute is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always bumper-to-bumper move it but\Nwe're stuck here there's just too
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much traffic have you forgotten there's\Na sidewalk use it the sidewalk but
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's covered with people heading home\Nfrom work and your point go yes sir
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster, yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay it's running hurry up\Nand get on Polnareff oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the things I do for you. But\NI've done everything you've asked so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.39,0:18:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll spare my life right there's\Nno need to kill a helpless senator
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:18:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.93,0:19:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What other explanation is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if a senator like me could be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to catch up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.05,0:19:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't use the world\Nif I'm this far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Dio's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.13,0:19:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hakuin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.57,0:19:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.99,0:19:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deflected my attack\Nwith the flick of a finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.45,0:19:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He barely moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:19:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even dodged the\Nconcentrated splash? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he bring out his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have missed that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too far away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My punch seems to have thrown\Nhim out of the world's range.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.53,0:20:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what precisely would I gain by\Nexplaining this situation to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.81,0:20:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention to the road and drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.41,0:20:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were way too close to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only a few months\Nago when Dio asked
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.43,0:20:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me if I was really going\Nto vomit out of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.41,0:20:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That monster had the audacity\Nto tell me I should relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.91,0:21:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.74,0:21:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never lose to you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you catch a glimpse of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.73,0:21:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw it when I attacked\NDio from ten meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had gotten any closer,\NI would have been done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we know one thing for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand holds a power more horrific\Nthan we could have ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, we know two things about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his stand doesn't have the reach of my\NHierophant Green or your Hermit Purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a close-range power stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like Star Platinum, and has\Na range of about 10 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.53,0:21:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it attacked with its fist, so it doesn't\Nuse projectile weapons like bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being said,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we can sneak up on\Nhim and get within range,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.75,0:21:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we just might have a chance\Nof finishing him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to figure out his secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, we have to exercise extreme\Ncaution when approaching this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.39,0:21:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does car suddenly stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to be hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.13,0:22:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.35,0:22:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know now how to uncover\Nthe secret of Dio's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.47,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.79,0:23:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever I think about Avdol and Iggy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.11,0:23:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it makes the hairs on the\Nback of my neck stand on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's because they were the\Nfirst to treat me like a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.07,0:23:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends and I were on\Na journey to defeat Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.31,0:23:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, here it comes!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.48,0:23:42.48,Next Episode,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,230)\fs100.001}Episode 46
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.48,0:23:42.48,Next Episode,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\fs100.001}Dio's World, Part 2

